WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.404
[BIRD CHIRPING]

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:04.734
- Nia!

00:00:04.734 --> 00:00:05.970
Hi Dad!

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:07.290
There you are.

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:08.407
Hi Nia!

00:00:08.407 --> 00:00:09.690
Hi Papa!

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:13.160
Are you ready for your
lesson in becoming a knight?

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:14.710
Who am I battling?

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:18.660
Being a not-yet knight is
about more than battling.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:23.730
Let me tell you about a time
I learned a valuable lesson.

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:24.840
What's your name?

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:25.680
Grunt.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:26.850
[GRUNTING]

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:29.150
No-- no, my name is Grunt.

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.020
Oh.

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:33.210
I'm a bridgeless troll.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:34.380
Let's go.

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:36.492
I was determined
to find his bridge.

00:00:39.264 --> 00:00:43.454
A not-yet knight never
breaks their promise.

00:00:43.454 --> 00:00:47.430
I've never seen
anything like it!

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:50.520
You are going to be
quite the knight, Nia.

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:54.380
Do you understand
now why you can't--

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:55.200
Nia?

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:56.580
Got it, Dad.

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:58.800
Think you could give
me a little help here?

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.540
I'm not sure she got
the right lesson.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:02.870
Oh, she'll get there.

